      "jcr:created": "Thu May 27 2021 19:52:36 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h1><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Strok<span class=\"futura-bold\">Enomics</span><sup>®</sup><br>\n Driven by data.<br>\n Tailored for you.</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Using powerful economic and clinical data, our team is here to help you gain economic sustainability and navigate&nbsp;funding barriers. Let’s develop a tailored strategy, so you&nbsp;can deliver better care in better ways.&nbsp;<br>\n <br>\n This product is only available to healthcare professionals.<br>\n</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><a href=\"mailto:strokenomics@stryker.com\"><span class=\"standalone-link\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Talk with us</span></span></a></span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 24 2024 17:53:10 GMT+0000",
