      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n <br>\n <br>\n Take advantage<br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #af6d04;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">of our training</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">We provide educational trainings that take your knowledge&nbsp;a level higher. These educational modules can be customized&nbsp;based on the specific opportunity you have or challenge you face.</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
